>> Animal := Oġġett ġdid.
Animal meta: ['sound:'] agħmel: { :s proprju sound := s. }.
Animal meta: ['makeSound'] agħmel: { Ħruġ ikteb: proprju sound. }.
>> Cat := Animal ġdid.
Cat meta: ['init'] agħmel: { proprju sound := ['MEOW!'].}.
Cat meta: ['meow'] agħmel: { innifsu makeSound. }.
Cat init.
Cat meow.
